-- title:
--   The phase step as a fine IL run
-- statement:
--   **The `phase` step as a fine IL run.** On a clean managed state whose data stack holds an encoding `zs` of `x` (entries of `≤ wb` bits per component), `fcode (phaseProg …)` leaves an encoding of `(RStep.den T (phase w k₀ k₁ a)) *ᵥ x` (same bit bound), at cost `(mn + 1) · cPass wb 2^{mn} (w 2^{mn}) Z`.
--
