--       ∃ zs', Rep zs' ((P8Lift.RStep.den T (P8Lift.RStep.phase w k₀ k₁ a)).mulVec x) ∧ NLogN.KFB.GB wb zs' ∧
--         IRuns I iprog (fcode (phaseProg m n w.val k₀ k₁ a)) (encK s f)
--           (encK s (Function.update f 0 (gflat zs' ++ l)))
--           ((m * n + 1) * NLogN.KFB.cPass wb (2 ^ (m * n)) (w.val * 2 ^ (m * n))
--             (zsz (((4 * (3 * 2 ^ (m * n) + w.val * 2 ^ (m * n))) : ℕ) : ℤ)))
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFB: the `phase` step as a fine-cost item-language program*: The state `x : Fin W × Addr m (Fin n) → ℂ` of the restricted interface is encoded role-major
--   as a Gaussian array: role `w`, address `b` at index `w · 2^{mn} + aidx b`, where
--   `aidx b = Σ_{(r,c)} b(r,c) · 2^{c + n r}` (`finProdFinEquiv`).
